config.description:
Map with config options for this specifc auth strategie

```graphql
query GetAuthStrategies {
  authentication {
    strategies {
      title
      key
      props {
        key
        value
      }
    }
  }
}
```

strategy_key.description:
Unique Identifier of the auth strategie to use (e.g. local, oauth2, oidc, keycloak, ldap)

```graphql
query GetAuthStrategies {
  authentication {
    strategies {
      title
      key
      description
    }
  }
}
```

